WEBVTT

00:00:55.910 --> 00:00:59.250
Death incarnate, huh?

00:01:16.010 --> 00:01:20.310
Mother, Father, how are you faring?

00:01:25.110 --> 00:01:27.900
I remain, as always, a lost cause.

00:01:27.900 --> 00:01:31.950
This curse, which takes
the life of anything I touch,

00:01:31.950 --> 00:01:33.990
shows no signs of breaking.

00:01:33.990 --> 00:01:37.530
My Lady, another animal
touched the boy and...

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:40.870
Living under the same roof
as him makes me livid with fear!

00:01:40.870 --> 00:01:42.920
Send him to our villa.

00:01:42.920 --> 00:01:45.250
That child is like Death incarnate...

00:01:46.960 --> 00:01:51.300
Why did the witch put this curse on me?

00:02:06.900 --> 00:02:10.570
There is something else that troubles me.

00:02:10.570 --> 00:02:11.780
And that is...

00:02:11.780 --> 00:02:15.740
Your Grace, your tea is ready.

00:02:15.740 --> 00:02:16.990
Don't stand so close to me!

00:03:46.990 --> 00:03:51.000
Episode 1 

00:03:54.630 --> 00:03:58.220
Aren't you going to send that letter?

00:03:58.220 --> 00:04:00.220
I couldn't!

00:04:00.220 --> 00:04:03.720
I haven't written a letter in so long.

00:04:03.720 --> 00:04:05.470
It was for practice.

00:04:08.140 --> 00:04:09.350
This is really good!

00:04:09.350 --> 00:04:10.600
Thank you.

00:04:13.070 --> 00:04:18.820
My maid's name is Alice. I have no
idea what goes on in her head.

00:04:18.820 --> 00:04:22.530
She knows if I touch her,
she'll die, but...

00:04:22.530 --> 00:04:25.120
It's rather chilly today, isn't it?

00:04:25.120 --> 00:04:26.950
She says one thing and does the opposite.

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:31.290
Every day she tries to get a rise out
of me, and then watches how I react.

00:04:32.710 --> 00:04:34.880
What's wrong, Your Grace?

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:38.670
What are you doing?

00:04:38.670 --> 00:04:42.010
I thought you wanted me to...

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:44.720
I didn't drop my head
down to see up your skirt!

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:47.640
I keep telling you to lay off
the sexual harassment!

00:04:47.640 --> 00:04:49.270
It makes it hard for me!

00:04:49.270 --> 00:04:51.190
I'm sorry.

00:04:51.190 --> 00:04:54.270
But I can't stop!

00:04:54.270 --> 00:04:56.280
You're awfully sure about that!

00:04:56.280 --> 00:04:59.190
You should put your own safety first.

00:04:59.190 --> 00:05:03.620
You're the one maid who'll stay with me.

00:05:03.620 --> 00:05:05.120
I don't want to lose you.

00:05:06.370 --> 00:05:11.170
I don't know what I mean to you, but...

00:05:11.170 --> 00:05:13.880
How about another cookie?

00:05:13.880 --> 00:05:15.590
Were you listening to me?

00:05:15.590 --> 00:05:19.840
Up to the part where you said,
"I don't know what I mean to you, but..."

00:05:19.840 --> 00:05:23.390
Then you heard all of it!
And you just ignored me!

00:05:23.390 --> 00:05:27.390
There's still one left.
Please clean your plate.

00:05:27.390 --> 00:05:29.430
Fine, I will.

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:43.610
Don't make weird noises!

00:05:45.450 --> 00:05:48.080
That was an indirect kiss, wasn't it?

00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:51.910
You didn't have to say
that out loud, did you?

00:06:07.180 --> 00:06:10.430
I take the life of anything I touch...

00:06:10.430 --> 00:06:15.310
A witch put this curse
on me when I was five.

00:06:15.310 --> 00:06:20.070
Who she was, where she
came from, or why she did it...

00:06:20.070 --> 00:06:23.030
...my memory fails me.

00:06:23.030 --> 00:06:28.030
"No one shall love you,
and you shall love no one."

00:06:28.030 --> 00:06:31.250
"You shall live a life of misery."

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:35.790
All I remember are the witch's words.

00:06:35.790 --> 00:06:41.340
Turning her back on me, my mother
gave me this mansion in the forest,

00:06:41.340 --> 00:06:44.220
and I haven't seen my family since.

00:06:44.220 --> 00:06:47.010
If only I could break the curse,
I could go home.

00:06:47.010 --> 00:06:49.600
To the home where I belong...

00:07:09.120 --> 00:07:11.290
What are you doing, Your Grace?

00:07:13.040 --> 00:07:16.920
Alice! N-Not this again!

00:07:16.920 --> 00:07:20.210
I told you to lay off
the sexual harassment!

00:07:20.210 --> 00:07:25.670
You always react so innocently. It makes
me want to tease you all the more!

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:32.260
Alice is the only daughter of the head
maid at my family's residence.

00:07:32.260 --> 00:07:35.560
I've known her since she was a child.

00:07:35.560 --> 00:07:39.610
I hadn't seen her for a while,
until about two years ago,

00:07:39.610 --> 00:07:42.520
when for reasons I don't
understand, she came here...

00:07:42.520 --> 00:07:43.570
Your Grace.

00:07:48.740 --> 00:07:50.700
Cheer up.

00:07:50.700 --> 00:07:53.450
That won't make me feel better!

00:07:57.410 --> 00:07:59.120
You stopped, then started again!

00:07:59.120 --> 00:08:01.540
Alice, cut it out!

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:03.170
I may not look like it,
but I'm a man, you know!

00:08:03.170 --> 00:08:06.630
What if I give into temptation
and touch you?

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:10.680
Do you want to touch me?

00:08:16.180 --> 00:08:18.440
Stop toying with me...

00:08:32.450 --> 00:08:34.740
Good morning, Your Grace.

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:36.950
Why do you have to get so close?

00:08:36.950 --> 00:08:39.620
What if you touched me accidentally?

00:08:44.800 --> 00:08:46.260
This is awful...

00:08:46.260 --> 00:08:48.420
She saw the weird faces
I make in my sleep.

00:08:50.010 --> 00:08:52.010
I brought you your breakfast.

00:08:52.010 --> 00:08:55.010
I'm not hungry. And there's way too much.

00:08:55.010 --> 00:08:58.810
That's what you said when
you skipped dinner last night.

00:08:58.810 --> 00:09:03.310
Your mother used to insist that you eat
three square meals a day, didn't she?

00:09:03.310 --> 00:09:05.820
It's not fair of you to
bring up my mother.

00:09:05.820 --> 00:09:08.190
I'm worried about you.

00:09:08.190 --> 00:09:10.650
What if you should fall ill...

00:09:10.650 --> 00:09:14.700
...and never be able to spend your
nights fooling around with me again...

00:09:14.700 --> 00:09:17.620
Spend my nights doing what with you?!

00:09:17.620 --> 00:09:24.170
It's true, I do feel bad that I never
finish the food you make me.

00:09:24.170 --> 00:09:25.790
I can eat a little, I guess.

00:09:25.790 --> 00:09:28.840
Okay, say aah.

00:09:28.840 --> 00:09:30.970
You really want to feed me, huh?

00:09:37.310 --> 00:09:39.730
She's staring at the inside of my mouth!

00:09:41.310 --> 00:09:45.520
I'm sorry, I don't get many
chances to see inside your mouth.

00:09:45.520 --> 00:09:46.230
I couldn't help it.

00:09:46.230 --> 00:09:48.230
Well, don't!

00:09:48.230 --> 00:09:52.950
As an apology, would you care
to have a look inside my mouth?

00:09:54.280 --> 00:09:56.740
Y-You don't have to show it to me!

00:09:56.740 --> 00:09:59.290
I'll eat on my own.
Hand me the fork.

00:09:59.290 --> 00:10:00.540
Here you are.

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:11.090
Your Grace, why are you
so uninterested in eating?

00:10:11.090 --> 00:10:13.300
Why?

00:10:13.300 --> 00:10:19.470
Because ever since I was cursed,
mealtimes were the worst part of the day.

00:10:21.480 --> 00:10:25.850
It's been slow, but ever since you
came here, I've started to eat more.

00:10:25.850 --> 00:10:27.820
I'm grateful, even if I don't look it.

00:10:32.320 --> 00:10:34.660
I'll clear away these dishes.

00:10:41.330 --> 00:10:42.750
Oh, I almost forgot.

00:10:42.750 --> 00:10:45.920
Your Grace, your childhood friend
Philip says he'd like to see you,

00:10:45.920 --> 00:10:48.380
as it's been too long.

00:11:02.060 --> 00:11:06.270
Mother, it seems that Philip
was here just now.

00:11:06.270 --> 00:11:08.900
That's none of your concern, dear.

00:11:33.800 --> 00:11:38.590
I told him I'd see him, but now that
the day is here, I'm getting cold feet.

00:11:39.680 --> 00:11:42.390
Is it too late to refuse?

00:11:42.390 --> 00:11:44.980
Send him a letter saying
I can't meet today.

00:11:44.980 --> 00:11:48.980
It's too late for that. Just accept it.

00:11:48.980 --> 00:11:51.980
Do you remember Philip?

00:11:51.980 --> 00:11:57.070
Indeed. He was a lively young boy,
very unusual for a noble's son.

00:11:57.070 --> 00:11:59.450
He used to chase you around
with a snake in his hand...

00:11:59.450 --> 00:12:00.990
...or throw bugs at you.

00:12:00.990 --> 00:12:03.830
Yeah, he was a bit of a troublemaker.

00:12:03.830 --> 00:12:05.790
But...

00:12:05.790 --> 00:12:10.250
...you're looking forward
to meeting him, aren't you?

00:12:10.250 --> 00:12:13.460
H-H-Hello there!

00:12:13.460 --> 00:12:15.710
Don't peek inside my room!

00:12:15.710 --> 00:12:20.090
Anyway, it's been so long
since we've had guests.

00:12:20.090 --> 00:12:21.760
I'll change into my formal attire.

00:12:21.760 --> 00:12:24.350
Very well. I'll take your
tuxedo out of storage.

00:12:24.350 --> 00:12:25.930
Now, about that hat...

00:12:25.930 --> 00:12:27.810
I'm absolutely,
positively not taking it off!

00:12:27.810 --> 00:12:32.900
My naturally curly hair and these circles
under my eyes make me look so uncool.

00:12:32.900 --> 00:12:35.110
I need to hide them with a hat, at least.

00:12:35.110 --> 00:12:37.360
I don't think so at all.

00:12:38.950 --> 00:12:45.490
You have hair that people love to curl
around their fingers, mysterious eyes,

00:12:46.830 --> 00:12:50.670
and such kissable lips...

00:12:53.420 --> 00:12:55.670
I'll get your tuxedo ready.

00:12:59.680 --> 00:13:02.180
Will this do?

00:13:02.180 --> 00:13:04.470
Thank you, Alice.

00:13:04.470 --> 00:13:06.680
You can leave while I change.

00:13:06.680 --> 00:13:09.060
No, I'll help.

00:13:09.060 --> 00:13:11.150
I can change on my own!

00:13:11.150 --> 00:13:14.020
I can't take my clothes off
in front of a girl!

00:13:14.020 --> 00:13:17.440
Would you feel less self-conscious
if we both took our clothes off?

00:13:17.440 --> 00:13:19.570
What on earth are you thinking?!

00:13:19.570 --> 00:13:23.070
If you don't start taking your
clothes off, I'll take mine off first.

00:13:23.070 --> 00:13:25.370
What kind of threat is that?!

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:36.340
To be honest, I'm a little
hopeful about today.

00:13:36.340 --> 00:13:38.630
I gathered as much.

00:13:38.630 --> 00:13:40.340
Make sure you don't touch me directly.

00:13:40.340 --> 00:13:41.720
Of course.

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:50.230
When I was cursed, and my family
and friends all started to avoid me,

00:13:51.940 --> 00:13:56.520
he was the one person
who looked at me differently.

00:13:56.520 --> 00:13:59.320
I've never forgotten that.

00:14:00.820 --> 00:14:04.450
Now that the day is here, I feel
nervous about meeting him, but...

00:14:04.450 --> 00:14:06.580
...if he's willing to give
me another chance,

00:14:06.580 --> 00:14:09.410
perhaps we can be friends again.

00:14:09.410 --> 00:14:11.830
I'll put your tie on, then.

00:14:11.830 --> 00:14:13.290
Oh, thank you.

00:14:15.380 --> 00:14:17.380
Stay still.

00:14:17.380 --> 00:14:18.500
You're too close!

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:21.220
Don't yell into my ear, please.

00:14:24.380 --> 00:14:28.350
Don't behave like this
when Philip is around.

00:14:28.350 --> 00:14:33.560
I just don't want another man
to see your bare skin.

00:14:33.560 --> 00:14:38.360
Don't worry. I only do it for you.

00:14:38.360 --> 00:14:42.240
I-I see.
Then, I guess that's okay...

00:14:42.240 --> 00:14:45.110
It's only fun if I get
to see your reaction.

00:14:45.110 --> 00:14:48.280
Scratch that! It's not okay!

00:14:51.830 --> 00:14:55.000
H-Hello there, Philip.

00:14:55.000 --> 00:14:57.960
Y-Yeah. Thanks for having me.

00:14:57.960 --> 00:14:59.710
How many years has it been?

00:14:59.710 --> 00:15:01.960
You're not going to throw
bugs at me, are you?

00:15:01.960 --> 00:15:04.380
Bugs? What are you talking about?

00:15:04.380 --> 00:15:09.260
Have you forgotten? You used to
play all kinds of pranks on me.

00:15:09.260 --> 00:15:11.640
You've really mellowed out.

00:15:11.640 --> 00:15:15.770
That's so long ago
I don't remember it, but...

00:15:15.770 --> 00:15:17.230
I'm sorry!

00:15:17.230 --> 00:15:21.150
N-No, it's not that I wanted
you to apologize...

00:15:21.150 --> 00:15:22.400
My Lord!

00:15:24.650 --> 00:15:26.110
Don't worry.

00:15:26.110 --> 00:15:30.530
They're just... um... making a cool pose!

00:15:47.800 --> 00:15:52.180
The fact that I'd gotten my hopes
up only makes it feel worse.

00:15:59.350 --> 00:16:02.270
So, what do you want, Philip?

00:16:02.270 --> 00:16:06.320
No, um... It's nothing special.

00:16:06.320 --> 00:16:09.570
I just wanted to see an old friend...

00:16:09.570 --> 00:16:13.830
Say, aren't you the daughter
of the family's head maid?

00:16:13.830 --> 00:16:16.330
Yes. You remembered me?

00:16:16.330 --> 00:16:18.750
Yes, I remember you well.

00:16:18.750 --> 00:16:20.830
Why are you working here as a maid?

00:16:20.830 --> 00:16:22.420
Is it just the two of you living here?

00:16:22.420 --> 00:16:24.250
Normally I have a butler as well.

00:16:24.250 --> 00:16:27.260
He hurt his back and is resting.

00:16:27.260 --> 00:16:29.220
But he'll be back soon.

00:16:29.220 --> 00:16:31.640
I-I see.

00:16:44.610 --> 00:16:46.030
Your Grace!

00:16:46.030 --> 00:16:47.820
I'm fine.

00:16:47.820 --> 00:16:49.110
What about you?

00:16:50.450 --> 00:16:53.160
W-We're fine!

00:17:00.750 --> 00:17:03.130
Are you leaving so soon?

00:17:03.130 --> 00:17:07.010
Yeah. We've talked enough.

00:17:07.010 --> 00:17:09.260
I'm sorry, where is the lavatory?

00:17:09.260 --> 00:17:11.050
I'll show you the way.

00:17:29.700 --> 00:17:31.740
Yes?

00:17:31.740 --> 00:17:33.570
Just hear me out.

00:17:33.570 --> 00:17:36.030
Why don't you come back to town with us?

00:17:37.700 --> 00:17:40.040
It's dangerous for you to stay with him.

00:17:40.040 --> 00:17:43.750
I'll find you another job, if you like.

00:17:43.750 --> 00:17:45.590
You must leave this place at once.

00:17:45.590 --> 00:17:46.550
No.

00:17:46.550 --> 00:17:47.800
Why not?

00:17:47.800 --> 00:17:50.380
Has he threatened you? Or...

00:17:50.380 --> 00:17:51.380
Philip!

00:17:53.340 --> 00:17:56.640
Don't say anything that
would cause her trouble!

00:17:56.640 --> 00:18:01.480
You can disrespect me all
you want, but not Alice!

00:18:01.480 --> 00:18:03.770
Your Grace, please calm down.

00:18:05.860 --> 00:18:08.110
S-Stay away!

00:18:08.110 --> 00:18:11.360
Don't come near me, you monster!

00:18:18.950 --> 00:18:24.000
I-I didn't even want to come here...

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:27.630
Then why did you?

00:18:27.630 --> 00:18:31.880
Your mother wanted me
to see how you were doing.

00:18:33.880 --> 00:18:38.180
There's talk of having your younger
brother inherit the family title.

00:18:39.310 --> 00:18:44.900
Knowing your family, if that happens,
they'll cut off ties with you entirely.

00:18:46.310 --> 00:18:47.520
My Lord?

00:18:47.520 --> 00:18:49.940
I'm okay. I'll be right there.

00:18:53.700 --> 00:18:56.530
I may be scared of you,

00:18:56.530 --> 00:18:58.780
but I pity you, too.

00:19:00.290 --> 00:19:04.580
Telling you the truth is
my way of making amends.

00:19:04.580 --> 00:19:07.330
I'm sorry about all this.

00:19:07.330 --> 00:19:10.340
I'll never come back here again.

00:19:22.140 --> 00:19:23.350
Farewell.

00:19:27.400 --> 00:19:28.610
Your Grace...

00:19:32.440 --> 00:19:34.360
I'm totally fine!

00:19:34.360 --> 00:19:36.820
Let's just forget about it
and have dinner.

00:19:36.820 --> 00:19:38.870
Let me know when it's ready.

00:19:52.380 --> 00:19:54.840
You're so good at the piano...

00:19:54.840 --> 00:19:56.220
Let's play again sometime!

00:19:56.220 --> 00:19:58.340
We'll always be buddies!

00:20:04.980 --> 00:20:08.400
This curse will be broken...

00:20:08.400 --> 00:20:09.810
Or it won't...

00:20:09.810 --> 00:20:12.730
My family will accept me again...

00:20:12.730 --> 00:20:14.530
Or they won't...

00:20:14.530 --> 00:20:17.990
Alice loves me...

00:20:17.990 --> 00:20:20.820
She loves me not...

00:20:23.370 --> 00:20:24.450
Your Grace?

00:20:26.160 --> 00:20:28.960
Dinner is ready.

00:20:28.960 --> 00:20:31.920
Are you feeling better now?

00:20:31.920 --> 00:20:33.300
Oh, uh-huh...

00:20:39.550 --> 00:20:42.470
I'm a lost cause...

00:20:42.470 --> 00:20:47.350
Whenever you're away, I always think about
things that make me feel ill at ease.

00:20:47.350 --> 00:20:49.940
My past self. My future self.

00:20:49.940 --> 00:20:52.480
And my present self.

00:20:52.480 --> 00:20:58.110
I've got no confidence in anything.
I bet you hate me, too.

00:20:58.110 --> 00:21:04.410
I feel like I don't even
have the right to love you.

00:21:04.410 --> 00:21:06.950
I can't touch you...

00:21:06.950 --> 00:21:12.500
I'll never know the heat of another's
body nor the warmth of their tears.

00:21:12.500 --> 00:21:14.800
If I wanted to give you a present...

00:21:16.670 --> 00:21:19.970
...even a flower, it will just
wilt in my hands.

00:21:19.970 --> 00:21:24.300
Philip was right. I'll never go back
to the house I grew up in.

00:21:24.300 --> 00:21:26.470
I'll remain a monster that everyone
has turned their back on--

00:21:26.470 --> 00:21:28.310
Your Grace.

00:21:28.310 --> 00:21:30.020
Didn't you know?

00:21:33.060 --> 00:21:35.980
In the language of flowers,
a wilted white rose means

00:21:35.980 --> 00:21:39.280
"to swear your whole life to someone."

00:21:42.200 --> 00:21:46.200
This is more than enough
of a present for me.

00:21:46.200 --> 00:21:50.210
Let's break your curse together.

00:21:55.630 --> 00:21:56.880
Someday...

00:21:58.340 --> 00:22:03.890
...I'd like to put a ring on your
finger with my own hands.

00:23:05.410 --> 00:23:08.410
I see... So that's how it is.

00:23:08.410 --> 00:23:11.910
Yes. There's no sign of
the curse being broken,

00:23:11.910 --> 00:23:14.330
but he seems to be
leading a peaceful life.

00:23:14.330 --> 00:23:15.830
Thank you.

00:23:15.830 --> 00:23:17.380
You may leave.

00:23:26.550 --> 00:23:27.850
Thanks for such a wonderful meal.

00:23:28.890 --> 00:23:31.470
You ate quite a lot.

00:23:31.470 --> 00:23:36.520
Yeah... I guess it's because
I was feeling kind of tense today.

00:23:38.190 --> 00:23:40.320
Alice,

00:23:40.320 --> 00:23:43.780
thanks for always making
such delicious meals.

00:23:45.450 --> 00:23:49.370
I'll go on making them.

00:23:49.370 --> 00:23:53.500
Breakfast, lunch, and dinner.

00:23:54.870 --> 00:23:58.710
Just for you, Your Grace. Always.

00:24:05.960 --> 00:24:10.970
The 
Duke
 of
 Death
 and
 His
 Maid

00:24:06.380 --> 00:24:09.890
The Duke, His Butler, and a Lost Cat.
